      "read": true,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I also found a typo some time ago; I had to dig a bit to find it but here it is.</p><p>On the civilian card from the expansion, the first ongoing ability says, &quot;At the end of the round, each civilian moves up to its move value towards the closest scenario marker, the hero players deciding ties.&quot;</p><p>It actually took me a couple reads to figure out that it was supposed to say, &quot;the hero players decide in ties.&quot;&nbsp;</p>",
